%N A401645 a(0) = 1; a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n-1} binomial(n-1,k) * binomial(n+k-1,k) * a(k).
%F A401645 G.f. A(x) satisfies: A(x) = 1 + (2*x/(Pi*(1 - x))) * Integral_{t=0..Pi/2} A(4*x*sin(t)^2/(1 - x)^2) dt.
%F A401645 a(n) ~ c * 2^(n*(n-1)) * exp(n/2) / (Pi^(n/2) * n^(n/2 - 1/8)), where c = 3.015456827022549918499055728375440217952105856175266182606278811180487... - _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Nov 01 2026
%t A401645 a[0] = 1; a[n_] := a[n] = Sum[Binomial[n - 1, k] Binomial[n + k - 1, k] a[k], {k, 0, n - 1}]; Table[a[n], {n, 0, 14}]
